{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id40205345"}, "name":{"label":"mfermier"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-15T14:11:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13517967584"}, "title":{"label":"Good, but removing features & slow on watch"}, "content":{"label":"I like this app a lot.\n\nHowever, I'm not sure what happened to the future where you could click on the show in one of your lists and \"go to podcast\" to see the rest of that shows episodes.\n\nAlso, on the watch when I am using it without my phone a lot of times I can't just start streaming an episode like I can on the Apple Podcast watch app. Makes it hard to use the watch app without the phone nearby.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
