{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id106840526"}, "name":{"label":"Scarlac"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-12T15:31:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13506527809"}, "title":{"label":"What is this"}, "content":{"label":"What is the point of this app. I am greeted with a screen to log in or add pod casts. If I tap add I’m on a screen with a list of nothing. A few buttons to filter on. I can’t search for anything (no results) and I can’t add anything, because I don’t know the URLs. I don’t understand what the hype is for this app as it provides literally no functionality. Do I need a companion app on my laptop or something? If so, that seems terrible.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
