{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id226628445"}, "name":{"label":"Moe Rubenzahl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-09T07:44:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13494035799"}, "title":{"label":"The best podcast app, continuously improved"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Overcast for many years because of its superior capabilities and excellent usability. \n\nMost of its best features are not things you notice right away. For instance, you can manage your podcast list so that it presents you what you want to hear, when you want to hear it. As you use the app more and more, you discover great ways to make it work your way. \n\nThe biggest feature, I think, is the ability to play at higher speed. It doesn’t just chop out pieces of audio and speed up the audio, it does it extremely intelligently so that you can listen at very high speeds and still have it be highly understandable. \n\nThe way the app removes silences is particularly brilliant, often increasing speed by 20 or 30% in a way that isn’t even noticeable.\n\nThere are lots of subtle interface refinements. For instance, after you pause the podcast, it will backspace a little so that when you replay you get a little context of where you came from and you don’t miss any key phrases. \n\nWhen pausing or when going back or forward, it looks for pauses in the speech, so you never get a chopped syllable. Very smooth.— must users probably don’t even notice this.\n\nOverall, I think it’s the most usable podcast app. It’s also the most refined, because it’s continuously updated. Sometimes the updates create interface changes that are a little jarring, but once you get used to them, you see that each change is an enhancement.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
