{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id965607001"}, "name":{"label":"🌜Strega🌛"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-04T23:33:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13476829522"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic app, great updates"}, "content":{"label":"I switched to Overcast after stitcher went under and I could not be happier. It’s easy to add shows from places like Patreon and the customizability is great as well! Making playlists is a breeze and I also love that there are listening stats as well! lol it’s exciting to see how many hours I’ve sunk into any given podcast.\n\nThe “premium” version is reasonably priced and it pays for a whole year!! I think it was like $15-16 usd? I would be totally willing to pay a up to like $25 for the whole year it’s so great!!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
