{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id21177329"}, "name":{"label":"smashlier"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T18:47:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13457022279"}, "title":{"label":"Still the best podcast app out there"}, "content":{"label":"I started using Overcast at least 8 years ago as an alternative to the Apple native podcast app. It was miles above the native one in functionality then and remains so now. Last I checked, Overcast is a one-man project and because of that, this isn’t beholden to shareholders. Instead, he listens to his community of users and responds to requests and continually pushes out a better and better product. Could not recommend this app highly enough.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id34438009"}, "name":{"label":"jxpx777"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T17:57:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"13456893505"}, "title":{"label":"Back to excellence"}, "content":{"label":"I was having an annoying issue with playback crashing. I got an email from the developer with an explanation and a way to help figure out the problem. Fortunate timing, though, because an iOS update was released at the same time and I haven’t seen the problem since. Will keep an eye out but I’m thrilled that Overcast is back to its old self for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id102258595"}, "name":{"label":"whatwouldruthdo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T16:56:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13456738143"}, "title":{"label":"Keeps getting better!"}, "content":{"label":"I have used and appreciated the Overcast app for years. I love being able to customize so many settings and preferences and to organize my many podcast subscriptions in such useful ways. \n\nThe ability to create multiple playlists makes it easy to accommodate the entire family on roadtrips without sacrificing access to my daily listens. I also love using playlists to keep my subscriptions organized by topic, genre, and even my moods.\n\nAnd we never miss new uploads of our favorite listens.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id49995521"}, "name":{"label":"Matt Arch"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T11:15:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13455829977"}, "title":{"label":"Better and Better"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast has always been the best (shopped around a looong time ago and was thrilled to find it back then), and it keeps getting better and better. So excited when new updates drop. Looks great, works great, tons of useful functionality. I’m a user for life. Thanks, Overcast!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26744029"}, "name":{"label":"terrilee_nc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T11:07:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13455804780"}, "title":{"label":"The BEST podcast app!"}, "content":{"label":"Updated review 2025!\nOvercast continues to be a superior podcast app and Marco keeps improving it. He’s also very responsive to comments and requests! The ability to add, edit, and rearrange playlists is simply the best. I love the color and icon choices for playlists. \nThe playback sound is terrific and you can now fine-tune playback speed by tenths. Five stars all the way! \n(Original Review)\nI came to Overcast on the recommendation of a friend after Apple Podcast app started taking forever to load and burning up my battery. It’s a great alternative. I like the Smart Speed option - I barely notice the pod speeding up - though I wish I could automatically speed through the ads! 😉", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id190154118"}, "name":{"label":"mi8482"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T09:03:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13455405489"}, "title":{"label":"Head and shoulders above iOS Podcast app"}, "content":{"label":"I love it. Clean, intuitive, and well ordered.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id480296333"}, "name":{"label":"dustimuphins"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T08:05:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13455206684"}, "title":{"label":"The Best Podcast App"}, "content":{"label":"I started using Overcast when it was $9.99 a year because I was so frustrated with how bad the apple podcast app was. I then was upset that the price of Overcast was raised to $15 per year. So I decided to boycott the raise in price and went back to the apple podcast app. Here I am 4 months later, going against my want to boycott price raising, to use Overcast again because I had forgotten how horrible the apple podcast app is. You got me Overcast, even though I am barely scraping by, I guess I’ll pay for another subscription for something that used to be free 20 years ago (NPR public radio)  and then was $9.99 six years ago. I gotta hand it to you, good job on your platform it is a pleasure to use.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id538145971"}, "name":{"label":"Travis Tracy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-29T03:58:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13454381231"}, "title":{"label":"Finally an app that I use!"}, "content":{"label":"Most apps in the App Store seem to be cash-grabs or for something that I have no interest in. But I do listen to podcasts. This app is great, inexpensive, and reliable. I really like the customization it allows, with “pins,” in how I can prioritize certain podcasts I subscribe to over others. The UI is easy to manage. And it has nice “vanity” features like customizable colors. And the addition of episode images is my favorite new thing they’ve added!  Plus I feel like I because supporting something that singularly dedicated to podcasts, it can focus on making the podcast experience better rather than another Spotify/iTunes clone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
